{"uid":"thig2.5","title":"Cittā","reference":"Therīgāthā 2.5","blocks":[{"kind":"verse","lines":["Even though I’m skinny,","sick, and very feeble,","I climb the mountain,","leaning on a staff.","Having laid down my outer robe,","and overturned my bowl,","propping myself against a rock,","I shattered the mass of darkness."]}]}
